Perform evidence-based cleanup after establishing the baseline and identifying the dependencies.

Look for:

* Dead code.
* Duplicate functions.
* Unused imports.
* Unreachable branches.
* Duplicate components.
* Unused assets.
* Obsolete mock-payment code.
